#: ../source/notebooks/general/other_nuts_samplers.ipynb:10003
#: 6738eb71844c48a1ba99d64093679a3a
msgid "Other NUTS Samplers"
msgstr "Otros muestreadores NUTS"

#: ../source/notebooks/general/other_nuts_samplers.ipynb:10005
#: d8cc0250d5684ff7811e23619704e2e2
msgid ""
"In this notebook we show how to fit a CLV model with other NUTS samplers."
" These alternative samplers can be significantly faster and also sample "
"on the GPU."
msgstr ""
"En este cuaderno mostramos cómo ajustar un modelo de CLV con otros "
"muestreadores NUTS. Estos muestreadores alternativos pueden ser "
"significativamente más rápidos y también muestrear en la GPU."

#: ../source/notebooks/general/other_nuts_samplers.ipynb:10008
#: e6a7590edf054bb9accd93da9db804bc
msgid "You need to install these packages in your Python environment."
msgstr "Necesita instalar estos paquetes en su entorno de Python."

#: ../source/notebooks/general/other_nuts_samplers.ipynb:10012
#: 1b1dcf3a1e34470fa3f7c0816fc0c8e4
msgid "You can pass the exact same `nuts_sampler` argument to the MMM models."
msgstr ""
"Puede pasar el mismo argumento `nuts_sampler` exactamente a los modelos "
"MMM."

#: ../source/notebooks/general/other_nuts_samplers.ipynb:10016
#: 5c938e6e5697485d9c304a94013ba84b
msgid ""
"GPU support only works with select samplers in PyMC that use the "
"[JAX](https://github.com/jax-ml/jax) backend. These samplers include "
"`numpyro`, `blackjax`, and `nutpie`."
msgstr ""
"El soporte de GPU solo funciona con selectos muestreadores en PyMC que "
"utilizan el backend de [JAX](https://github.com/jax-ml/jax). Estos "
"muestreadores incluyen `numpyro`, `blackjax` y `nutpie`."

#: ../source/notebooks/general/other_nuts_samplers.ipynb:10018
#: 364e2bad9ee7458593d917c064fdb663
msgid ""
"Make sure the GPU is registered, follow the instructions "
"[here](https://github.com/jax-ml/jax?tab=readme-ov-file#installation)."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrese de que la GPU esté registrada, siga las instrucciones "
"[aquí](https://github.com/jax-ml/jax?tab=readme-ov-file#installation)."

#: ../source/notebooks/general/other_nuts_samplers.ipynb:20002
#: 13c07c2b613343a9bb50cca738c094c6
msgid ""
"For the purpose of illustration, we will use the same data and model as "
"in the other CLV notebooks."
msgstr ""
"A efectos de ilustración, utilizaremos los mismos datos y modelo que en "
"los otros cuadernos de CLV."

#: ../source/notebooks/general/other_nuts_samplers.ipynb:50002
